2 id=&#34;2024&#34;&gt;2024&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; ISMC&lt;/strong&gt; · Raleigh, NC · &lt;a href=&#34;https://drive.google.com/file/d/16B3cWBmTKjeeYjOecXsO29nPhJEkw2g8/view?usp=sharing&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Membrane Fluctuations in Migrating Mesenchymal Cells&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; ISMC&lt;/strong&gt; · Raleigh, NC · &lt;a href=&#34;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-Svnp--ddswIpQ49P4koGb03A-2EQJ_s/view?usp=sharing&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;NeuroBoids&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;APS Physics Summit&lt;/strong&gt; · Minneapolis, MN · &lt;a href=&#34;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ivSibbx63STTkefsHomQYbJUPNstry1-/view?usp=sharing&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Dynamics of Innovation: From Particles to Ideas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
